    Proposed-By: recovery-steward
    Reviewed-By: reviewer-6gqkm39hk0myasfnmqqwfd-rostova
    Review-Reason: Correctly raises the board-trail subprocess timeout from 30s to a bounded configurable default of 60s (with fallback) so 42s scans are not misreported as unavailable, and adds a focused regression that timeout failures remain explicit as not_measured/timed out.
